# Flow-Cortex Frontend environment variables.
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and adjust values. `.env*` (except *.example)
# is git-ignored.

# The app reads no variables today. It calls the API at the relative path
# `/api/v1`: `npm run dev` proxies `/api` to http://localhost:8080 and the
# nginx image proxies it to the backend container.
